{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026DWQfMfFGUv1793224749.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>天氣概況：隨著東北季候風逐漸緩和及高空反氣旋增強，今明兩日廣東天色普遍晴朗。預料一股偏東氣流會在周末期間影響華南沿岸，該區雲量逐漸增多。另一股東北季候風會在下周初至中期影響華南。</p><p></p><p>本港地區今日天氣預測：大致多雲。初時有一兩陣微雨。日間漸轉天晴及乾燥，最高氣溫約29度。吹和緩至清勁東風，初時離岸及高地間中吹強風。</p><p></p><p>展望：未來一兩日日間大致天晴及乾燥。星期日雲量增多。</p><p></p><p>05:45 更新</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T02:00:49.992956+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":192,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T22:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T13:38:19.603681+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T01:58:15.031517+00:00","content_hash":"b7a5a57a37cc6e5383f1eb7a58b4ba49b044a9c317410e7a1957e25c9e92d2c9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T02:00:49.992956+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}